@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanLoginUI as LoginUI
boundary FormResetPasswordUI as ResetUI
control ResetPasswordController as Controller
entity EmailService as Email

== Main Flow ==

User -> LoginUI : 1: Klik Lupa Password
activate LoginUI
LoginUI -> ResetUI : 1.1: tampilkan()
activate ResetUI
ResetUI --> User : 1.1.1: Form untuk memasukkan email

User -> ResetUI : 2: Masukkan email
User -> ResetUI : 3: Klik tombol Kirim Link Reset
ResetUI -> Controller : 3.1: kirimLinkReset(email)
activate Controller
Controller -> Email : 3.1.1: kirimEmailReset(email)
activate Email
Email --> User : 3.1.2: Email dengan link reset terkirim
deactivate Email
Controller --> ResetUI : 3.1.3: Email terkirim
ResetUI --> User : 3.1.4: Pesan konfirmasi pengiriman email
deactivate Controller

User -> ResetUI : 4: Buka link dari email
ResetUI -> Controller : 4.1: validasiLinkReset(link)
activate Controller

alt [Link valid]
    Controller --> ResetUI : 4.1.1: Link valid
    ResetUI --> User : 4.1.2: Form password baru
    
    User -> ResetUI : 5: Masukkan password baru dan konfirmasi
    User -> ResetUI : 6: Klik tombol Reset Password
    ResetUI -> Controller : 6.1: resetPassword(passwordBaru)
    Controller --> ResetUI : 6.1.1: Password berhasil diubah
    ResetUI --> User : 6.1.2: Notifikasi sukses
else [Link tidak valid atau sudah kadaluarsa]
    Controller --> ResetUI : 4.1.1a: Error "Link tidak valid"
    ResetUI --> User : 4.1.2a: Pesan error
end

deactivate Controller
deactivate ResetUI
deactivate LoginUI

@enduml
